<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Sections 2, 3, 5, 6 and 7 are deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2009."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
