<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 4 is deemed to have come into operation on 28 August 2008. Amendment of section 4"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
