<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Judges’ Remuneration Act 1971 [Act 45], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in the proviso of section 4 by substituting for the words “1/2” the words “3/5”. Amendment of section 5"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
