<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The amendment in subsection (1) shall apply to a Judge who is still in service or has retired from service before the commencement of this section. Amendment of Third Schedule and Fourth Schedule"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
