<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Third Schedule and the Fourth Schedule to the principal Act are amended by substituting for the figures “180” appearing in the column “Formula” the figures “216”. Savings and transitional"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/5/eng@> .
